  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Yue village is a middle-sized clan. Its academy Gu storage is only middle tier quality, so a Jade Skin Gu there is rather impossible.",
      "chapters": [
        62
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_gu_yue_village",
        "gu_jade_skin_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with some fortune, Gu Yue remains a middle-sized clan under competition with two other villages and wolf tide pressure, so rank four Gu in storage stay relatively few.",
      "chapters": [
        160
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limited-fortune",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Enslavement path Gu Masters demand heavy resources. Even a middle-sized clan cannot afford to feed one. At most large or super clans nurture a few for war.",
      "chapters": [
        350
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
